 "Meta Quest 5.png", "id": "1069171079447513", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593938515_1069171082780846_4689642208279957038_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v6sT7VAuancQ7kNvwHINog7&_nc_oc=Adpky3fcqRxh4wZBU42QLgR8BOOTBEr7xxn0ASoi4MJf2kKtrL5gxSUFieEdsoe-LD8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRmXH5TGJZMDl1vBz57haitQQj0QAPNMUwYuHTdE81qVQ&oe=6B0865A9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "M\u0100ORI+", "keywords": ["Movies", "TV", "Streaming", "Maori", "Aotearoa"], "long_description": "M\u0100ORI+ - Nau mai, haere mai to our world of content.\n\nDiscover a world of M\u0101ori stories, culture and entertainment, all in one place. Watch your favourite programmes on demand, stream live channels and events, and enjoy content made for the whole wh\u0101nau - anytime, anywhere.\n\nWith the M\u0100ORI+ app, you can:\n- Stream M\u0100ORI+ shows whenever it suits you\n- Save your favourites shows to My List and watch them later\n- Pick up where you left off across your devices\n- Create dedicated profiles for each of your wh\u0101nau members\n- Browse content across easy-to-navigate categories\n- Watch LIVE channels, programmes and special events", "short_description": "M\u0100ORI+ - Nau mai, haere mai to our world of content.\n\nDiscover a world of M\u0101ori stories, culture and entertainment, all in one place. Watch your favourite programmes on demand, stream live channels and events, and enjoy content made for the whole wh\u0101nau - anytime, anywhere."}]}, "developer_name": "Whakaata M\u0101ori", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.maoriplus.co.nz/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.maoriplus.co.nz/terms-of-use", "publisher_name": "Whakaata M\u0101ori", "support_website_url": "https://help.maoriplus.co.nz/", "website_url": "https://www.maoriplus.co.nz/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTA